  <h2>What Resurface is</h2>
  <p>
    A question bank with spaced repetition, aimed at UK medical students. It
    serves multiple-choice questions, schedules them for review, tracks your
    progress, and can generate additional questions from study material you
    provide.
  </p>
  <p>
    It is a study tool. It is not a substitute for your curriculum, your
    lectures, your textbooks, or your clinical teachers, and it has no
    affiliation with any medical school, examining body, or the GMC.
  </p>

  <h2>Accuracy, and its limits</h2>
  <p>
    Questions are written and reviewed by people, and can contain mistakes.
    Questions produced by Generate are written by an AI model and are
    <strong>not reviewed by us before you see them</strong> — they can be
    confidently, plausibly wrong. Medicine also changes; an explanation that was
    correct when written may not be now.
  </p>
  <p>
    We make no promise that the content is accurate, complete, or current. If
    you spot an error, please tell us — it helps everyone using the bank.
  </p>

